        "message": "Verify native reserves and simultaneous two-pair completion\n\nAdd 82 public proofs in 13 new modules: full partner signatures and weighted whole-boundary reserves, actual residual-copy transport, four-label protected grouping and native palettes, simultaneous two-pair completion, exact reserved boundaries, and terminal gluing for two closed pairs.\n\nThe full strict build passed 3914 jobs. The unchanged transitive axiom audit checked 14994 declarations, adding 164 complete public/private/generated proof records while preserving all 14830 previous declarations and 2844 previous result mappings. All 878 frozen inputs and 10 controls remained unchanged.\n\nRetain complete source and declaration maps, frozen inputs and outputs, environment metadata, independent review, and all genuine successful and failed focused logs. The numbered inventory remains 51/69; Lemma 4.4, Corollary 4.5, and the main theorem remain unverified.\n\nPublish the exact tree of local checkpoint 2f772802b06983c100bd9101ce7e2adcc039e13a: 122633011a768e72f2849f2a79a6896a1d44dcfd. All authorized sources, manuscript excerpts, complete maps, frozen evidence, environment metadata, and genuine successful and failed logs are included.",
